Subject: [PATCH 09028/15333] MAINTAINERS: media: nxp: imx8-isi: Add Frank Li
 as reviewer and i.MX mailing list

Add Frank Li as a reviewer and the i.MX mailing list for the i.MX8 ISI
driver. This helps ensure patches receive review by the NXP i.MX
maintainers.

Signed-off-by: Frank Li <Frank.Li@nxp.com>
Reviewed-by: Laurent Pinchart <laurent.pinchart@ideasonboard.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260630163456.3317624-1-Frank.Li@oss.nxp.com
Signed-off-by: Laurent Pinchart <laurent.pinchart@ideasonboard.com>
Signed-off-by: Hans Verkuil <hverkuil+cisco@kernel.org>
---
 MAINTAINERS | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

